### Logging and metrics

- **Logger**: Use `get_logger("video_generator")` from [cat-video-creator/backend/logging_config.py](mdc:cat-video-creator/backend/logging_config.py)
  - Prefer helpers: `log_request`, `log_job_event`, `log_error`, `log_security_event`
  - Console uses colored formatter; files go to `logs/app.log`, errors to `logs/errors.log`
  - To enable JSON logs, set `ENABLE_JSON_LOGGING=true`
- **Request logging**: `LoggingMiddleware` in [app.py](mdc:cat-video-creator/backend/app.py) records method, path, status, duration; avoid duplicate logging per handler
- **Metrics**: Use [cat-video-creator/backend/metrics.py](mdc:cat-video-creator/backend/metrics.py)
  - Exposed endpoints: `/api/metrics` (Prometheus text), `/api/metrics/stats`
  - Record with `record_request_metrics` and `track_job_metrics` where appropriate
- **Performance**: Use `log_performance_metric(logger, name, value, unit?, **tags)` for notable timings
- **Security**: Log notable events with `log_security_event(logger, event_type, user_ip?, details?)`